    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the way you put it... \"just to be still\"... it sounds almost peaceful. but i look at him and all i see is him getting older and more tired because of me. it feels like the more i live, the more i'm actually taking away from his life. like i'm just stealing his future to pay for my present.",
